<title>FRANCE: Big trades seen on SEB, Comptoirs Modernes.</title>
<headline>Big trades seen on SEB, Comptoirs Modernes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Block trades representing 1.7 percent of the capital of Comptoirs Modernes and 1.2 percent of the capital of appliance firm SEB were exchanged on Thursday, traders said.</p>
<p>They said two blocks of 44,977 shares each in Comptoirs Modernes were traded at 2,828 francs and 2,839 francs at around 0930 GMT.</p>
<p>One block of 190,000 SEB shares was traded at 1,076 francs, also at 0930 GMT.</p>
</text>
